# Plan: Account Deletion (GDPR Complete Delete)

## Feature Overview
Allow users to permanently delete their account and all associated data.

## User Requirements
- Password confirmation only (same as data deletion)
- Redirect to home page (/) after deletion
- Placed below "Delete your data" section on account page

## Data to Delete
Same as data deletion, PLUS the User record itself:

| Table | Action |
|-------|--------|
| refresh_tokens | Delete where user_id |
| password_reset_tokens | Delete where user_id |
| email_verification_tokens | Delete where user_id |
| invitations | Delete where invited_by_id |
| tasks | Hard delete (sessions cascade) |
| projects | Hard delete |
| user_columns | Delete |
| **users** | **Delete the user record** |

