## Frontend Implementation

### 1. API Method
**File:** `frontend/src/services/authApi.ts`

```typescript
async deleteAccount(password: string): Promise<{ message: string }>
```

### 2. Confirmation Modal
**File:** `frontend/src/components/modal/DeleteAccountModal.tsx` (NEW)

Same pattern as DeleteDataModal but with different messaging:
- Title: "Delete your account?"
- Warning: "This will permanently delete your account and all data. You will not be able to recover your account."
- Password input
- Cancel and Delete buttons

### 3. Account Page Update
**File:** `frontend/src/app/account/page.tsx`

Add section below "Delete your data":

```tsx
<section className="account-section">
  <h2 className="account-section-title">Delete your account</h2>
  <p className="account-section-desc">
    This will permanently delete your account and all your data.
    You will not be able to log in or recover your account.
  </p>
  <button onClick={() => setShowDeleteAccountModal(true)} className="account-danger">
    Delete my account
  </button>
</section>
```

After successful deletion:
- Call `logout()` to clear auth state
- Redirect to `/`

